LangString CloseRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Close dsh and dsh-TUI before continuing. Running PID(s): $Running"
LangString CloseRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请先关闭 dsh 和 dsh-TUI，再重试。正在运行的进程：$Running"
LangString KernelAhead ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installed DSH $KernelInstalled is outside this TUI's supported range. Replace it with ${KERNEL_VERSION}?"
LangString KernelAhead ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装的 DSH $KernelInstalled 超出本版 TUI 的兼容范围。是否替换为 ${KERNEL_VERSION}？"
LangString KernelConfirm ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Replacing the shared DSH kernel may affect other plugins and existing sessions. Confirm replacement?"
LangString KernelConfirm ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "再次确认：回退共享 DSH 内核可能影响其他插件和既有会话。确定替换内核吗？"
LangString TuiAhead ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer TUI is installed ($TuiInstalled). Downgrade it to ${TUI_VERSION}?"
LangString TuiAhead ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装更新的 TUI（$TuiInstalled）。是否降级为 ${TUI_VERSION}？"
LangString TuiConfirm ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Confirm TUI downgrade? Older versions may not understand newer preferences or sessions."
LangString TuiConfirm ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "再次确认：旧版 TUI 可能无法读取新版偏好或会话。确定降级吗？"
LangString InstallFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation did not complete.$\r$\n$Failure"
LangString InstallFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装未完成。$\r$\n$Failure"
LangString KeepKernel ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keeping compatible DSH $KernelInstalled."
LangString KeepKernel ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "保留兼容的 DSH $KernelInstalled。"
LangString InstallKernel ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing/updating DSH to ${KERNEL_VERSION}."
LangString InstallKernel ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装或更新 DSH 至 ${KERNEL_VERSION}。"
LangString LaunchTui ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Start dsh-TUI"
LangString LaunchTui ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "启动 dsh-TUI"
LangString RemoveTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose what to uninstall"
LangString RemoveTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "选择卸载范围"
LangString RemoveNote ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Credentials, sessions, preferences and profiles are always preserved."
LangString RemoveNote ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "凭据、会话、偏好和 Profile 始终保留。"
LangString RemoveTui ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Remove TUI only; keep the shared DSH kernel (recommended)"
LangString RemoveTui ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "仅卸载 TUI，保留共享 DSH 内核（默认）"
LangString RemoveBoth ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Remove both TUI and the shared DSH kernel"
LangString RemoveBoth ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "完全卸载：移除 TUI 和共享 DSH 内核"
LangString SharedWarning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Other profiles may depend on DSH: $OtherProfiles.$\r$\nRemove the shared kernel anyway?"
LangString SharedWarning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "检测到可能依赖 DSH 的其他 Profile：$OtherProfiles。$\r$\n仍要移除共享内核吗？"

LangString WelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Welcome to the dsh-TUI Setup Wizard"
LangString WelcomeTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "欢迎使用 dsh-TUI 安装向导"
LangString WelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This wizard installs dsh-TUI, the DeepSeek Harness terminal interface, for the current user only. No administrator rights are needed.$\r$\n$\r$\nSetup reuses a compatible Node runtime or supplies the official portable one, installs the bundled offline packages, and prepares the profile at $PROFILE\.dsh\profiles\dsh-tui.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Next to review every change before anything is written. Click Cancel to exit without touching your system."
LangString WelcomeText ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "本向导将 dsh-TUI（DeepSeek Harness 终端界面）安装到当前用户，无需管理员权限。$\r$\n$\r$\n安装程序会复用兼容的 Node 运行时，或在缺失时释放官方便携版；随后安装随包的离线组件，并准备 $PROFILE\.dsh\profiles\dsh-tui 配置文件。$\r$\n$\r$\n点击“下一步”可在写入任何文件前核对本次变更；点击“取消”将不做任何改动直接退出。"
LangString FinishTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "dsh-TUI is installed"
LangString FinishTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "dsh-TUI 安装完成"
LangString FinishText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "dsh-TUI is ready. Start it from the desktop shortcut or run dsh-tui / dst in a new terminal, then complete the first-run account setup."
LangString FinishText ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "dsh-TUI 已就绪。可从桌面快捷方式启动，或在新终端中运行 dsh-tui / dst，然后按提示完成首次账号设置。"
LangString ConfirmTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Review before installing"
LangString ConfirmTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装前确认"
LangString ConfirmNote ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Nothing is written until you press Install."
LangString ConfirmNote ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "在你点击“安装”之前，不会写入任何文件。"
