LangString ConfirmRuntime ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "Node 运行时"
LangString ConfirmRuntimeReuse ${LANG_ENGLISH} "reuse the compatible Node already installed"
LangString ConfirmRuntimeReuse ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "复用已安装的兼容 Node"
LangString ConfirmRuntimeInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "install the bundled portable Node"
LangString ConfirmRuntimeInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "释放随包的便携版 Node"
LangString ConfirmWarnKernel ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Warning: this replaces a DSH kernel outside the supported range and needs two more confirmations."
LangString ConfirmWarnKernel ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "警告：将替换超出兼容范围的 DSH 内核，稍后需要两次确认。"
LangString ConfirmWarnTui ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Warning: this downgrades an installed newer TUI and needs two more confirmations."
LangString ConfirmWarnTui ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "警告：将降级已安装的更新版 TUI，稍后需要两次确认。"
LangString ConfirmAccept ${LANG_ENGLISH} "I understand the changes above and want to install dsh-TUI."
LangString ConfirmAccept ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "我已了解以上变更，并确认安装 dsh-TUI。"
